# Catalyst IOS-XE - selected fan/power/temperature status rows.
Value SWITCH (\d+)
Value COMPONENT (\S+(?:\s+\S+)?)
Value STATUS (\S+(?:\s+\S+)?)
Value TEMPERATURE_C (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*Switch\s+${SWITCH}\s+FAN\s+${COMPONENT}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*FAN\s+${COMPONENT}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*(?:Power Supply|POWER SUPPLY|PSU)\s+${COMPONENT}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*SYSTEM TEMPERATURE\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Temperature\s*:\s*${TEMPERATURE_C}\s*(?:C|Degree Celsius|degrees C)?\s*$$ -> Record
